Is making tuxemon fight analogous to dog-fighting or cock-fighting, or bear-baiting or fox-hunting? Is making them breed a kind of factory farming? Is capturing tuxemon slavery? 

This ties in with [[the origin of tuxemon]], with the idea that tuxemon are synthetic, digital or mindless being proposed as a way of escaping these ethical quandaries. 

=== Possibilities ===

* Tuxemon battle as sport - just like humans do boxing or taekwondo (tamashihoshi)
* As elemental spirits, tuxemon grow and develop by interacting with all the elements of the universe. Battle is a particularly effective way of doing this (Sanglorian)  
* Tuxemon are mindless automatons, perhaps because they are exclusively digital

